@@ -2,7 +2,8 @@
 
 A single-file Bash point-of-sale and inventory system for small retail shops.
 No cloud. No database. No internet required. All data lives in plain CSV files
-that open directly in Excel.
+that open directly in Excel. Ships with a self-contained HTML dashboard and an
+optional localhost web UI with billing (`shopkeep-web.py`, Python stdlib only).
 
 ## User story
 
@@ -16,19 +17,47 @@ purpose.
 
 ```bash
 chmod +x shopkeep.sh
-./shopkeep.sh              # interactive menu
+./shopkeep.sh              # interactive menu (18 options + 0 to exit)
 ./shopkeep.sh --doctor     # check dependencies
+./shopkeep.sh --selftest   # integrity tests (28 checks)
 ```
 
+## Dashboard (new in v1.3.0)
+
+```bash
+./shopkeep.sh web          # (re)generates shopkeep-dashboard.html
+```
+
+ONE self-contained file — inline CSS/JS, zero external requests (no CDN, no
+web fonts, no remote images), a JSON snapshot of your data baked in at
+generation time. Two ways to use it:
+
+- **Read-only snapshot** — double-click the file (`file://`). A banner reminds
+  you: *"Read-only snapshot — run python3 shopkeep-web.py for live mode +
+  billing."*
+- **Live mode + billing** — `python3 shopkeep-web.py`, then open
+  `http://127.0.0.1:8000`. The server binds 127.0.0.1 ONLY, reads the CSVs for
+  display, and forwards billing to `./shopkeep.sh bill` as a subprocess —
+  **shopkeep.sh stays the ONLY writer to the CSVs**; Python never writes them.
+
+Panels: products (search / sort / low-stock highlight / expiry flags / HSN),
+categories & combo trays, today's sales (revenue, units, bills, voided, top
+products), inventory log (newest first, filter by event type), and a billing
+form (barcode-qty lines + phone + discount %) in live mode. All money math in
+the browser is integer paise; ₹ is applied only at display time.
+
 ## Usage
 
 ### Interactive menu (no arguments)
 
 ```
- 1) 🧾 New bill      2) ➕ Add product    3) ✏️ Manage product
- 4) 🔍 Search        5) 📦 Inventory      6) ⚠️ Low stock
- 7) 📊 Summary       8) ↩️ Void           9) 💰 Stock value
-10) 🧺 Trays        11) 💾 Backup       12) 🌐 Language    0) 🚪 Exit
+ 1) New bill          2) Add product      3) Manage product
+ 4) Search            5) Inventory        6) Low stock
+ 7) Expiry            8) Summary          9) Stock value
+10) Void             11) Return          12) Trays
+13) Categories       14) WhatsApp        15) Backup
+16) Config           17) Publish         18) Language
+ 0) Exit
 ```
 
 ### Non-interactive (cron / scripting friendly)
